      "markdown": "## Facts about our students\n\n• Approximately 470 English majors.\n\n• Roughly half to 2/3 are dual majors in Education.\n\n• Roughly half of our majors enter as transfer students.\n\nOur majors have had great success in a wide variety of careers and in graduate school.\n\nOur majors score above state average on Praxis 2 in subject matter\n\n• Two recent graduates earned a perfect score on Praxis.\n\nThree students have recently won Fulbright Awards, to South Korea (2007), Spain (2009), and South Africa (2010)\n\n• One 2010 graduate earned a prestigious book contract for a memoir (Alice Ozma, The Reading Promise)\n\n• See our Department Website (prospective student link) for information on careers for English Majors.",
